"%+.4f %+.4f %+.4f\n"
"%+.4f %+.4f %+.4f</tt>\n"
"\n"
"歸一化參數\n"
"曝光補償：　%+.2f EV\n"
"黑點偏移：　%+.4f"

#: ../src/iop/channelmixerrgb.c:2018
#, c-format
